 38: /// PlaceTicket* → LockRound → (sweat the sessions / cash out / play consumables) → FinishSweat →
 39: /// Settle → (Shop: buy/sell) → ExitShop → … Settle now DEDUCTS the round's payment from the bank
 40: /// (the income-rate race, design/10): a payment you cannot meet ends the run — unless the Totem
 41: /// of Undying fires (never on the final payment). Debt-as-HP and the float are deleted.
 42: ///
 43: /// Passives live in the <see cref="EffectEngine"/> (Multiplier / Scar Tissue / Totem — all payout
 44: /// effects multiply into Ticket.PayoutMultiplier). Consumables are a separate pool of player-TIMED
 45: /// verbs: Profit Boost at PlaceTicket, Mulligan Slip at a sweat's pending-loss window. The
 46: /// bookie GIFTS a consumable after consecutive losing rounds (the
