335:     /// <summary>Settles the round after the sweat: every still-Open ticket resolves Won (all active
336:     /// legs green — payout credited, scar carrier burns) or Lost (the scar feeds). Then the
337:     /// terminal-realization ledger runs (PLAN.md rev 5 §4): Free Bet refunds issue exactly once,
338:     /// early busts included.</summary>
