268:     /// Win side: stake × Π(offered odds of settled-Won legs) × (p_live × o) of the current leg
269:     ///   × Π(trueProb × o) of legs not yet started, voided legs dropped, × the payout product.
270:     /// Loss side: a locked Free Bet adds (1 − p_all) × stake — the refund is contract, and
